WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.780
Taco: Maxie! Do something!

2
00:00:04.781 --> 00:00:08.233
Maxie: Jack! That marker isn’t yours. It’s

3
00:00:08.234 --> 00:00:10.542
mine! So please give it back!

4
00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:13.832
Jack: No! Betty gave it to

5
00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:15.817
me! So it’s mine now!

6
00:00:15.818 --> 00:00:18.660
Maxie: Jack! Betty didn’t give it to you.

7
00:00:18.661 --> 00:00:22.658
She asked you to keep it in a safe place.

8
00:00:22.659 --> 00:00:26.275
Jack: Hmmm . . . What shall I make

9
00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:27.884
now? Oh, I know!

10
00:00:27.885 --> 00:00:34.535
I need to get ready for my new home!

11
00:00:34.536 --> 00:00:36.637
Maxie: Where is your new home?

12
00:00:36.638 --> 00:00:39.750
Where are you going, Jack? Jack:

13
00:00:39.751 --> 00:00:46.069
Well . . . Hee-hee-hee, hee-hee-hee.

14
00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:49.143
Maxie: Taco! Keep moving!

15
00:00:49.144 --> 00:00:51.936
Jack: Stop that! Hee-hee-hee . .

16
00:00:51.937 --> 00:00:56.674
. I’ll bite . . . ha-ha-HA-HA!

17
00:00:56.675 --> 00:00:59.056
Maxie: Taco! Jack is ticklish.

18
00:00:59.057 --> 00:01:00.805
Keep tickling him!

19
00:01:00.806 --> 00:01:03.400
Jack: I’m ticklish! Stop!

20
00:01:03.401 --> 00:01:11.199
Ha-ha-ha! Whoaaa! HA-HA-HA! Maxie:

21
00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:17.392
There! Now you can’t bite us! Taco:

22
00:01:17.393 --> 00:01:20.249
Maxie! The truck is stopping.

23
00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:21.836
Maxie: Where are we, Jack?

24
00:01:21.837 --> 00:01:25.574
Where are you going? Taco:

25
00:01:25.575 --> 00:01:27.567
Where?

26
00:01:27.568 --> 00:01:30.226
Maxie: Do you promise not to bite us?

27
00:01:30.227 --> 00:01:32.278
Will you be nice? Jack:

28
00:01:32.279 --> 00:01:34.791
Ouch! That hurt!

29
00:01:34.792 --> 00:01:37.270
My lips are all red now. Maxie:

30
00:01:37.271 --> 00:01:39.252
Where are you going, Jack? Jack:

31
00:01:39.253 --> 00:01:49.901
Me? To my new home in Hawaii!

